PS+=['Ariel: Peter and I are going to watch The Quiet Night at 10:30 p.m. Would you like to join us?\nDanny: Thank you for inviting me, but I have an English class at 11.\nAriel: Are you kidding me? An English class at 11?\nDanny: It’s an online (線上的) class, and I will take it at home.\nAriel: But why is it at 11? It’s pretty late at night.\nDanny: Because the teacher, Mr. Miller, will be teaching us in the USA. It’ll be 9 in the morning there. And my classmates are from around the world. We are in different time zones.\nAriel: It sounds interesting! Can you see each other’s faces?\nDanny: Of course. Let me show you our classroom. Look, I can see my classmates’ faces on the right-hand side.\nAriel: Will the teacher’s face be in the middle?\nDanny: No, Mr. Miller’s face will be on the top right corner, and the main (主要的) area (區域) is his computer screen. It’s like the blackboard in a school classroom.\nAriel: And what is the bottom part for?\nDanny: It’s for typing, but we only type when others can’t hear us.\nAriel: I see. It’s so cool!']
