PS+=['Hi Sarah,\nI’m writing to you because I need some help. As you know, Karen, Leo, and I decided to share an apartment last year, and all of us were excited about that. However, problems started to appear after we lived together for a month.\nPlease look at the floor plan of our apartment（見第 23 題附圖）. Because it seemed (似乎) a little strange for a girl and a boy to share a bathroom, Karen and I decided to share the one outside. So, Leo took the room with a bathroom, and he pays 500 NT dollars more than we do every month. Karen often cleans our bathroom. That is good, but the problem is—she doesn’t like anyone to use it right after she finishes cleaning. She wants to keep it clean too much, and sometimes that makes me feel stressed (有壓力的). Karen also cooks a lot. When she cooks, the smoke and smell get into my bedroom although my door is always closed. I’m thinking about changing bedrooms with Karen because hers is farther from the kitchen. Or, should I change with Leo so that I can have my own bathroom? I feel really “bothered,” but I don’t want to make them unhappy. Do you have any good ideas? Please let me know.\n\nMany thanks,\nZoe']
