PS+=['(PES TV is a television station in Utopia City. They’re talking about their current (目前的) TV programs in a meeting.)\nAmy: I think we should keep airing (播出) Scary Dragons. It has been our best TV program for the last two months.\nBen: It does well only because it is summer vacation. The vacation is about to end, and kids are going back to school. I don’t think there’ll be anybody watching it at home in the morning then. It’s a program for kids after all. What do you say, Cate?\nCate: I think we can keep doing the program but change its time. What about moving it to 20:00-22:00? Kids can watch it after they finish their homework.\nBen: Not good. Now we have City Girls during those two hours, and it is our second-best program. Over five thousand people love to watch the show in the evening.\nCate: Why don’t we stop airing Mother-in-Law and let Scary Dragons take its place? Mother-in-Law is our worst program.\nAmy: Mother-in-Law doesn’t have a large audience (觀眾), but I think it fails only because we put it in the wrong hours.\nCate: You’re right. It’s a program for housewives, but we air it between 16:00 and 18:00. Housewives need to cook dinner then and don’t have time for TV.\nBen: Housewives usually watch TV between 14:00 and 16:00. I think we can move Mother-in-Law to those two hours.\nAmy: Does that mean we’ll move the program in those two hours, Strange Food, to 10:00-12:00?\nBen: Right. Strange Food isn’t very popular, and usually there are the fewest people watching TV in the morning.\nCate: All right. Our new schedule (時刻表) looks great!\n（Program ①～④ 各年齡層收視人數長條圖見第 26 題附圖）']
